description:
A lock-only promotion PR to Theseus v0.2.5, then one PR adding:
- `.github/review-guidance.md` (D3: repository failure modes plus a do-not-flag list covering the no-docstring policy and changelog fragments), registered in gate_paths and the soundness manifest;
- policy keys `protocol.max_finding_rounds: 4`, pre-existing advisory for Medium/Low, and the intent block enabled;
- the weekly live eval schedule.
D10: the human step stays an owner instruction recorded for audit. D11: no separate owner-attention list, because the soundness manifest covers those paths. Revisit both if a second human reviewer joins.
